          "code": "GENERATECOMMUNICATION",
          "id": "1761636288303",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1761636288305_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Given this data:\n {{$context.$nodes.FOREACHREQUEST.$output}}\n \nProduce one \"text\" communication suggestion for each row in output (which has non empty messagecontent) with the following:\ntitle: Reply Required: <SrNumber>\ndescription: <SrNumber> has been reviewed by an agent and additional details are required.\nactionText: Send Reply\nInclude the following information in the communication content\n      Generate the content only as a customer reply template written from the employee’s perspective, based on <MessageContent>. Convert the agent’s requests into a natural reply where required information is represented using simple placeholders (e.g.,[start date], [return-to-work date], [employee ID]). Use rich HTML formatting for a professional email, preserve the original intent, do not add new information, and end with a courteous closing.\nGenerate the content using rich text, but strictly do not display html tags in the content.\n\nParameters: Also include the following additional parameters in the communication and derive their best value. They must not be included in the communication \"content\"\n      - SR_Number: Populate with the SR number\n      - channelId : <ChannelId>\n      - channelType: <ChannelTypeCd>\n      - Stripe : <SrStripeCd>\n      - Email_Subject: Reply: Generate a email subject from <Subject> or use <MessageContent> to generate a short subject\n      - personId: <PrimaryContactPersonId>\n\nIf {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.OraUserContext.locale}} exists, **Must** translate the entire output(except links and SRNumbers) to {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.OraUserContext.locale}} language.\n\nOrder the records by severity, with the highest severity at the top and the lowest at the bottom.\nLimit the output to a **maximum** of 3 SRs.\n\n\nSet the targetAgent for this communication as ORA_HELP_DESK_REQUEST_PENDING_MY_ACTION"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
